      "reason": "The IME owns a key while composing or reported as keyCode 229, before GPUI sees it, so the Enter committing a candidate is no PressEnter. An IME edit's prefix and suffix do not split a surrogate pair. A composition's start asks the focused input for its caret and moves the hidden input there, where the browser opens its IME panel. A consumer needs these (identical in both web crates)."
    },
